# test: recursion whose argument is a struct of 80 values exhausts the stack as a stack-exhausted panic
# Spec 06 Runtime Panics: flow.panic.stack-exhausted. Known failure #2183: today the frame
# block's separate stack memory wraps and traps as an internal error.

